abstract: >
  A series of five free mathematics textbooks forming a single coherent
  course from Grade 1 to the end of the bachelor's degree, with graded
  exercises and full solutions, in English, French, Dutch, Spanish,
  Portuguese and Hindi. Part of the One Course project.
